'''Chivalry and Candy''' (騎士道と菓子道, ''Kishidō to Kashidō'', '''Chivalry and the Way of the Pastry''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (M): Slow duration increases by 20%.

